### Arquivo de requisições de exemplo (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio / Rider)
@host = http://localhost:5203

### 1. Login como administrador
# @name admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

### 2. Login como aluno
# @name student
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "aluno", "password": "aluno123" }

### Tipos de questão e suas regras (público)
GET {{host}}/api/question-types

### Listar questões (Admin) — filtros opcionais: type, difficulty, search, page, pageSize
GET {{host}}/api/questions?type=SingleChoice&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Cadastrar questão de escolha única (Admin)
# @name created
POST {{host}}/api/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SingleChoice",
  "statement": "Qual função da FSharp.Core aplica uma função a cada item de uma lista?",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "options": [
    { "text": "List.map", "isCorrect": true },
    { "text": "List.iter", "isCorrect": false },
    { "text": "List.length", "isCorrect": false }
  ]
}

### Consultar questão (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/questions/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Alterar questão (Admin) — gera nova versão
PUT {{host}}/api/questions/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "MultipleChoice",
  "statement": "Quais funções da FSharp.Core transformam uma lista em outra lista?",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "options": [
    { "text": "List.map", "isCorrect": true },
    { "text": "List.filter", "isCorrect": true },
    { "text": "List.length", "isCorrect": false }
  ]
}

### Excluir questão (Admin)
DELETE {{host}}/api/questions/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Gerar prova aleatória (aluno: sem gabarito)
# @name exam
POST {{host}}/api/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{student.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prova de Programação Funcional",
  "sections": [
    { "type": "SingleChoice", "count": 2 },
    { "type": "TrueFalse", "count": 1 },
    { "count": 2 }
  ],
  "shuffleOptions": true
}

### Gerar prova com gabarito e semente fixa (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prova reproduzível",
  "sections": [ { "difficulty": "Easy", "count": 3 } ],
  "includeAnswerKey": true,
  "seed": 42
}

### Corrigir respostas
POST {{host}}/api/exams/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{student.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "{{exam.response.body.questions[0].questionId}}", "selectedOptionIds": [1] },
    { "questionId": "{{exam.response.body.questions[1].questionId}}", "selectedOptionIds": [2] }
  ]
}
